{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-83139","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115218","text":"RuneFort Interactive Layer — Build Order"}]},{"id":"blk-83140","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115219","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-83141","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115220","text":"Six prompts that transform RuneFort from a static fort visualizer into an interactive playground with BYOK chat, MCP tool connections, token flow animations, repo import, and workspace management."}]},{"id":"blk-83142","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115221","text":"Dependency Graph"}]},{"id":"blk-83143","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"RFORT-1 (BYOK) ──────┐\n                      ├── RFORT-3 (Chat) ── RFORT-4 (Token Flows)\nRFORT-2 (MCP) ───────┘\nRFORT-5 (Repo Import) ── standalone, uses fort generator\nRFORT-6 (Workspaces) ── standalone, uses auth + supabase"},{"id":"blk-83144","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115222","text":"Recommended Session Plan"}]},{"id":"blk-83145","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115223","text":"Session A: Foundation (RFORT-1 + RFORT-2)"}]},{"id":"blk-83146","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115224","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115225","text":": \"Build RFORT-1 and RFORT-2. Read "},{"id":"spn-115226","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-1_BYOK.md"},{"id":"spn-115227","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-115228","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-2_MCP.md"},{"id":"spn-115229","text":" for full specs. These are the foundation — BYOK key storage and MCP proxy/client. Port patterns from "},{"id":"spn-115230","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/lib/play/"},{"id":"spn-115231","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-115232","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/routes/api/play/mcp-proxy/"},{"id":"spn-115233","text":". Verify: API key modal opens, key persists in localStorage, MCP proxy forwards to graphonomous-mcp.fly.dev, tool discovery returns tools.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83147","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115234","text":"Session B: Chat (RFORT-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-83148","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115235","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115236","text":": \"Build RFORT-3. Read "},{"id":"spn-115237","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-3_CHAT.md"},{"id":"spn-115238","text":" for full spec. Add the chat panel with tool-use loop. The chat should use the BYOK OpenRouter key (from RFORT-1), call MCP tools via the proxy (from RFORT-2), and execute built-in fort navigation tools that zoom/navigate the fort view. Verify: chat sends messages via OpenRouter, tool calls work (both MCP and built-in), fort navigation tools zoom the view.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83149","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115239","text":"Session C: Token Flows (RFORT-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-83150","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115240","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115241","text":": \"Build RFORT-4. Read "},{"id":"spn-115242","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-4_TOKENFLOWS.md"},{"id":"spn-115243","text":" for full spec. Add animated particles on Svelte Flow edges representing token throughput. Include a benchmark simulation mode that cascades flows through PULSE phases. Verify: particles animate along edges, speed/color respond to metrics, simulation runs through all phases.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83151","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115244","text":"Session D: Repo Import (RFORT-5)"}]},{"id":"blk-83152","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115245","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115246","text":": \"Build RFORT-5. Read "},{"id":"spn-115247","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-5_REPO_IMPORT.md"},{"id":"spn-115248","text":" for full spec. Add GitHub repo import that converts repository structure into a fort. Directories → rooms, files → tiles, package manifests → gates. Verify: paste a GitHub URL, import generates a navigable fort, zoom works on imported fort.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83153","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115249","text":"Session E: Workspaces (RFORT-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-83154","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115250","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-115251","text":": \"Build RFORT-6. Read "},{"id":"spn-115252","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-6_WORKSPACES.md"},{"id":"spn-115253","text":" for full spec. Add workspace switching tied to amp.workspaces. Each workspace shows its own district of saved forts. Verify: workspace dropdown shows user's workspaces, switching reloads forts, demo mode works without auth.\""}]},{"id":"blk-83155","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-115254","text":"Context for All Sessions"}]},{"id":"blk-83156","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83158","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115255","marks":["bold"],"text":"Framework"},{"id":"spn-115256","text":": SvelteKit 2.x + Svelte 5 (runes: "},{"id":"spn-115257","marks":["code"],"text":"$state"},{"id":"spn-115258","text":", "},{"id":"spn-115259","marks":["code"],"text":"$props"},{"id":"spn-115260","text":", "},{"id":"spn-115261","marks":["code"],"text":"$effect"},{"id":"spn-115262","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-83157","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83160","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115263","marks":["bold"],"text":"Flow lib"},{"id":"spn-115264","text":": "},{"id":"spn-115265","marks":["code"],"text":"@xyflow/svelte"},{"id":"spn-115266","text":" v1.5.0"}]}],"id":"blk-83159","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83162","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115267","marks":["bold"],"text":"Style"},{"id":"spn-115268","text":": Dark theme, zinc-900 bg, amber-400 accents"}]}],"id":"blk-83161","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83164","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115269","marks":["bold"],"text":"SSR"},{"id":"spn-115270","text":": Disabled on "},{"id":"spn-115271","marks":["code"],"text":"/app"},{"id":"spn-115272","text":" route ("},{"id":"spn-115273","marks":["code"],"text":"export const ssr = false"},{"id":"spn-115274","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-83163","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83166","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115275","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-115276","text":": Lazy client via "},{"id":"spn-115277","marks":["code"],"text":"getSupabase()"},{"id":"spn-115278","text":" (returns null during SSR)"}]}],"id":"blk-83165","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83168","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115279","marks":["bold"],"text":"Existing code"},{"id":"spn-115280","text":": Marketing site + 5-level fort editor already built (see "},{"id":"spn-115281","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-115282","text":" tree)"}]}],"id":"blk-83167","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83170","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-115283","marks":["bold"],"text":"BendScript reference"},{"id":"spn-115284","text":": The "},{"id":"spn-115285","marks":["code"],"text":"/play"},{"id":"spn-115286","text":" implementation in "},{"id":"spn-115287","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/"},{"id":"spn-115288","text":" is the proven pattern to port from"}]}],"id":"blk-83169","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraa5lojeve4777h5qfp6ekocetb6qciap7kxofryxjb2e4jfakfi5a","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}